&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Self-driven, organized, and comfortable working in a fast-paced, high-growth environment with a high sense of&amp;nbsp; ownership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
