&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a finance professional who refuses to be just a gatekeeper. This role is not about data entry; it is about Data Architecture and Business Strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the de-facto Finance Lead for the Engage vertical, bridging the gap between strict Audit compliance and aggressive Sales targets. We need a &quot;builder&quot;—someone who can construct complex financial models, automate reporting logic, and sit across the table from Business Heads to drive P&amp;amp;L decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles and&amp;nbsp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Strategic Revenue Modelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage complex revenue recognition models You will be responsible for maintaining the logic that allows us to recognize revenue progressively rather than as a lump sum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a POC to the Sales team. Maintain and upgrade &quot;Scenario Simulators&quot; that help Key Account Managers structure profitable deals and predict their incentive achievements in real-time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Controllership &amp;amp; Audit Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit lead:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of the statutory audit for the division. You must be able to defend complex revenue positions to external auditors with deep technical rationale (IFRS/IndAS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Month-End Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the month-end close process. Ensure 100% accuracy in accruals and provisions, minimizing the timeline between month-end and final reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Working Capital &amp;amp; Cash Flow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Liquidity Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor the AP/AR split to ensure the division remains cash-flow positive, proactively flagging liquidity risks to the central treasury&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Automation &amp;amp; Process Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Move away from manual Excel dependencies. Maintain and build live dashboards (Looker/Excel) to give leadership a real-time view of &quot;Forecast vs. Actuals.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify bottlenecks in billing or reconciliation (e.g., Engineering/Product gaps) and lead cross-functional projects to fix them permanently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; CA / ACCA / MBA (Finance) or equivalent from a reputed institute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2–4 years of experience. Prior exposure to Fintech, SaaS, or high-transaction environments is a massive plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Excel:&lt;/strong&gt; VLOOKUPs, Index-Match, Pivot Tables and Advanced Excel fluency. You must know how to build models that don&#39;t crash under heavy data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Basic knowledge of SQL or experience with BI tools (Looker/PowerBI) is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong grasp of Revenue Recognition standards (IndAS 115).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First-Principles Thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t just follow the process; you ask, &quot;Why does this process exist?&quot; and fix it if it&#39;s broken. You are able to formulate new methodologies and come up with better fixes to problems on the go.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain complex accounting constraints to a sales head without using jargon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to guide and upskill interns/junior analysts, fostering a culture of ownership within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
