&lt;li&gt;Exposure to ML-based anomaly detection or NLP-driven log analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications: Security+, CISSP (Associate), or AI-specific credentials (e.g., AI/ML security, OWASP AI, GIAC)&lt;/li&gt;
