&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Principal Engineer to drive the architectural strategy and technical execution across our 80+ engineer Application Portfolio, encompassing all Web, Mobile, and Headless surfaces. This is a high-impact, individual contributor role where you will set the vision for our technology transformation, bridging the gap between deep frontend architecture and scalable, agentic API-first platforms. You will partner with Product leadership to drive customer-obsessed engineering, ensuring that our technical choices directly accelerate product velocity and user value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Vision: &lt;/strong&gt;Define and drive the technical strategy for the entire Applications Portfolio, establishing deep frontend architecture standards (Web, Mobile, Headless) to ensure consistency, scalability, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as a key mentor and coach to senior engineering talent, fostering a culture of technical excellence, high-impact decision-making, and proactive problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-Engineering Synergy: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate deeply with Product leadership to drive roadmaps, ensuring engineering strategy is inherently aligned with customer needs and product evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Facilitate alignment and clarity across teams regarding goals, outcomes, and timelines for complex, multi-team projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology Transformation: &lt;/strong&gt;Spearhead the evolution of our application architecture from a &#39;feature factory&#39; model to a platform-driven system, modernizing API layers and integrating emerging standards like the Model Context Protocol (MCP) to enable next-generation agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Systems Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with Design Systems teams to define and influence the evolution of shared UI components and design tokens, ensuring seamless integration with engineering architectural standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify and reduce systemic technical risks, enforce design principles, and raise the bar through hands-on technical reviews and prototyping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience (15+ years) as a senior/principal-level software engineer with deep expertise in Frontend architecture and large-scale application systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading technology transformation across organizations of 80+ engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of modern API design (REST, GraphQL) and its application in highly distributed, agentic environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with the Model Context Protocol (MCP) or similar agent-integration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product mindset: proven history of collaborating with Product leaders to solve complex customer problems with customer-obsession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance high-level architectural strategy with hands-on, production-level coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience evaluating and adopting new frontend technologies and frameworks, expertly balancing innovation with long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of designing and scaling robust frontend architectures that support high-traffic, complex user interfaces across massive datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Exceptional communication skills, with the ability to facilitate clarity and drive consensus across distributed teams.&lt;/p&gt;
